ut the Event: Detailed text and supporting images to explain event objectives and benefits."},{systemPrompt:"Agenda & Speakers: A combination of quick links and events sections to list session details and featured speakers."},{systemPrompt:"Countdown & Registration: A section featuring a countdown timer alongside an embedded registration form."},{systemPrompt:"Post-Event Engagement: A follow-up area using news or Yammer feeds for sharing recaps and audience feedback."}]},{pageScenario:"Event",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"Design an event page that effectively communicates key event details while inviting users to register and explore more information."},sectionOutlines:[{systemPrompt:"Header: Prominent event title with date, time, and venue information."},{systemPrompt:"Event Description: A comprehensive overview of the event’s purpose, agenda, and featured attractions."},{systemPrompt:"Registration Area: A dedicated section with a clear call-to-action, registration link, and a visual countdown."},{systemPrompt:"Detailed Agenda: A breakdown of sessions, speakers, and timelines for the event."},{systemPrompt:"Additional Information: A resource hub linking to maps, brochures, FAQs, and contact details."}]},{pageScenario:"Event",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"Develop an informative event page layout that provides a clear narrative about the event, along with structured sections for schedule, registration, and extra resources."},sectionOutlines:[{systemPrompt:"Hero Banner: Striking visual introduction with event name and essential details."},{systemPrompt:"Overview: Summary of the event’s objectives, benefits, and key highlights."},{systemPrompt:"Schedule: Detailed timeline of sessions and activities with descriptions."},{systemPrompt:"Registration and Feedback: An interactive area for signing up and leaving comments or feedback."},{systemPrompt:"Resource Hub: A section for additional documents, maps, FAQs, and support links."}]}],aW=[{pageScenario:"StatusUpdate",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"This page provides a comprehensive update on the current status of our projects. It includes a summary overview of progress, risks, and next steps, supported by visualizations and interactive reports, utilizing a combination of built-in web parts to enhance user experience."},sectionOutlines:[{systemPrompt:"Executive Summary: An overview of the current project status with key highlights and metrics."},{systemPrompt:"Key Metrics: Displaying project performance, milestones achieved, and potential bottlenecks using dynamic visual elements (e.g., Hero web part for striking metrics display)."},{systemPrompt:"Project Highlights: Featuring important announcements and success stories, leveraging News or Quick Links web parts for context."},{systemPrompt:"Upcoming Milestones: A timeline view of forthcoming deliverables and critical dates, possibly incorporating an Events web part."},{systemPrompt:"Detailed Reports: Embedding documents or lists via File Viewer or List web parts to provide in-depth insights and supporting data."}]},{pageScenario:"StatusUpdate",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"This status update page is designed to keep the team informed with the latest developments, combining clarity with interactive elements. It integrates various first party web parts to present a visually engaging summary of current progress and challenges."},sectionOutlines:[{systemPrompt:"Overview: A succinct introduction outlining the purpose of the update and the main topics covered."},{systemPrompt:"Highlights & Wins: Celebrating recent successes and achievements, using visual cues similar to Hero or News web parts."},{systemPrompt:"Challenges & Roadblocks: Identifying current issues and inviting discussion or solutions, potentially supported by commentary features."},{systemPrompt:"Action Items: Listing next steps and assignments in an interactive list format."},{systemPrompt:"Resources & Documents: Providing access to relevant reports, guidelines, or additional documentation via Document Library or File Viewer web parts."}]},{pageScenario:"StatusUpdate",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"This departmental briefing page offers a focused status update with insights on performance, ongoing initiatives, and strategic next steps. It leverages built-in SharePoint capabilities to integrate visual metrics and collaborative tools seamlessly."},sectionOutlines:[{systemPrompt:"Department Snapshot: An introductory section providing a quick overview of departmental performance and context."},{systemPrompt:"Performance Metrics: Highlighting key performance indicators using visual elements that could mimic a Hero or Chart web part."},{systemPrompt:"Current Initiatives: Detailed information on ongoing projects and their statuses, reflecting a List or News web part structure."},{systemPrompt:"Feedback & Discussion: Encouraging interaction through comments or integrated Yammer feeds to capture team input."},{systemPrompt:"Supporting Documents: Embedding relevant files or resources via Document Library or File Viewer for further reference."}]},{pageScenario:"StatusUpdate",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"This page delivers a concise and clear status update, highlighting progress, challenges, and next steps in a clean and structured design. The layout focuses on straightforward content presentation without reliance on specialized web parts."},sectionOutlines:[{systemPrompt:"Introduction: A brief overview that sets the context for the update."},{systemPrompt:"Current Status: A detailed section outlining ongoing projects, achievements, and any significant changes."},{systemPrompt:"Key Challenges: A focused look at obstacles and areas needing attention."},{systemPrompt:"Next Steps: A clear, actionable list of upcoming tasks and plans."},{systemPrompt:"Resources: Direct links and references to supplementary documentation or additional information."}]},{pageScenario:"StatusUpdate",aiContext:{systemPrompt:"This status update page offers a straightforward update on current operations, foc