  It is best suited for:
  - Conference or Webinar Speaker Highlights (brief intro on the left, speaker photo and key details on the right)
  - Employee or Team Member Spotlights (explain their role or accomplishments on one side, and show their profile on the other)
  - Guest Contributors or Authors (summarize what they've contributed or written on the left, present their bio info on the right)
  - Brand Ambassadors or Subject‐Matter Experts (highlight their expertise and relevance on the left, pair it with an image and credentials on the right)
  Because it places a short, engaging narrative beside a clear visual and identifying details, this layout draws quick attention to a single individual's significance and background.`,"Event scenario: Summarize important event details or announcements on the left (e.g., schedule changes or newly confirmed speakers) and showcase event organizers or key participants on the right. This provides a clear overview of updates while spotlighting the individuals who are central to the event.","StatusUpdate scenario: Present recent developments, feature improvements, or next steps on the left, and list responsible team members or stakeholders on the right. This arrangement allows viewers to quickly grasp the current status and identify who to contact for further details or collaboration."]}}initTemplateStructure(){return{columns:[{controls:[{relay:new aY}]},{controls:[{relay:new bh({postProcessConfig:{layout:"Large"}})}]}]}}}bz=(0,aP._ts_decorate)([i(a$.twoColumns_textAndPeople)],bz);class bA extends aU{initMetadata(){return{id:bA.id,sectionLayout:"twoColumns",defaultSystemPrompt:"This section has two text web parts, one in each column. Usually used for showing two different pieces of information side by side.",applicableScenarios:["Event: This template can showcase major accomplishments or highlights of an event in one column and outline upcoming sessions, registration details, or future activities in the other column, helping attendees quickly grasp both past achievements and upcoming opportunities.","StatusUpdate: This layout can be used to summarize key progress, milestones, or metrics in one column and outline upcoming tasks, deadlines, or action items in the other, offering a clear and organized view of a project or team’s ongoing work."]}}initTemplateStructure(){return{columns:[{controls:[{relay:new aY}]},{controls:[{relay:new aY}]}]}}}let bB={oneColumn:bm,twoColumns:{text:bA=(0,aP._ts_decorate)([i(a$.twoColumns_text)],bA),textAndImage:by,textAndPeople:bz,mapAndText:bx